00:21.889 --> 00:24.166
Councilmember Wright will lead us in the Pledge of Allegiance.

00:25.867 --> 00:29.419
Our Father in Heaven, we're grateful to be gathered today to conduct city business

00:29.919 --> 00:33.598
in this special council meeting, and we're grateful for all of our good citizens and

00:34.098 --> 00:38.460
