00:59.958 --> 01:03.823
with a good spirit and to always

01:03.856 --> 01:07.720
be kind to others and to remember to assume good intentions.

01:07.817 --> 01:10.745
And we say this in the name of Jesus Christ, amen. Amen.

01:10.810 --> 01:12.504
Councilman Bright. Uh,

01:16.764 --> 01:23.010
yeah, so we'll officially call this meeting to order at 3:32,

01:23.510 --> 01:26.060
and, uh, Councilmember Wright will lead us in the Pledge of Allegiance.

01:28.650 --> 01:45.650
I pledge

01:48.318 --> 01:53.404
All right, welcome. We did call the meeting to order already, but it is August

01:53.904 --> 01:58.292
10th and we're in a special council meeting. We have present online

01:58.893 --> 02:00.728
Councilmember Whiting and Councilmember Hewish,

02:02.960 --> 02:06.924
and in person here Councilmember Wright, Councilmember Clark, and myself

02:07.504 --> 02:10.889
with some staff members. So I

02:11.389 --> 02:14.587
just Uh, first item,

02:14.635 --> 02:18.308
and I do— and Kiara is also online. So the first item is a resolution

02:18.324 --> 02:21.981
of Eagle Mountain City, Utah, approving the fiscal year 2026 Community Development

02:22.094 --> 02:25.774
Block Grant, CDBG, annual action plan and authorizing

02:25.870 --> 02:29.341
its submission to the US Department of Housing and Urban Development. I do

02:29.841 --> 02:32.902
know that there's like 4 slides, and we'll turn it to Kiara.

02:34.609 --> 02:38.111
Uh, thank you, Mayor, and thank you, Council, and everybody who

02:38.304 --> 02:40.983
carved out time for this special meeting. Um, I know you're busy. I am going

02:41.483 --> 02:45.297
to do my best to make this fairly brief.

02:47.997 --> 02:49.922
Um, let me share my screen.

03:02.516 --> 03:03.096
Okay.

03:08.276 --> 03:12.058
Alrighty, so we are going over the Community Development Block

03:12.558 --> 03:13.319
Grant. Um, as we've mentioned in previous meetings,

03:15.673 --> 03:19.431
We have a 5-year plan which goes through 2028,

03:19.447 --> 03:23.333
and we are currently in year 3. Every year

03:23.446 --> 03:27.878
