17:55.170 --> 17:58.530
Um, while I'm kind of digesting it all, I think with

17:59.030 --> 18:02.750
my current workload it could work out, it could be fine. Um, Elizabeth's been

18:03.250 --> 18:06.510
great at training, and I'm definitely wrapping my head around other resources that we'll be

18:07.010 --> 18:10.270
able to tap into long term. But, um, yeah,

18:10.770 --> 18:12.970
so it would take— it would take a dedicated person. I don't know what my

18:13.470 --> 18:16.731
