18:34.120 --> 18:36.602
Um, Councilmember Wood or Whiting, any questions?

18:38.069 --> 18:41.220
No, I asked my questions, uh, on Tuesday nights.

18:41.316 --> 18:45.252
Yeah, no questions. You guys are good. If there's

18:45.752 --> 18:49.557
no other questions, um, one just to clarification,

18:50.215 --> 18:53.589
you mentioned a public hearing. We already had the public hearing. Yeah, we had that

18:54.089 --> 18:57.958
on last Tuesday. Yeah, so it's just on the notes. I just wanted

18:58.458 --> 19:01.042
to make sure. Um, so if there's no other questions,

19:01.476 --> 19:05.491
