19:05.991 --> 19:09.925
a resolution of Eagle Mountain City, Utah approving the fiscal

19:10.425 --> 19:14.208
fiscal year 2026 Community Development Block Grant CDBG Annual

19:14.465 --> 19:17.835
Action Plan and authorizing its submission to the U.S.

19:17.931 --> 19:20.948
Department of Housing and Urban Development.

